    # "Looking behind me, I could see everyone was back—dazed and confused, perhaps—but... alive and present."
    "Arkama bakarken, herkesin geri döndüğünü görebiliyordum—sersemlemiş ve kafası karışmış, belki—ama... canlı ve mevcut."

